‪I think I was sincere
‪and did the best I could.

453
00:21:59,109 --> 00:22:00,610
‪Q. TAE-HOON, WHAT MOMENT DO YOU REGRET?

454
00:22:00,694 --> 00:22:03,947
‪As I watched myself today,
‪I realized I slipped up a lot,

455
00:22:04,031 --> 00:22:06,408
‪starting with the sisters-in-law comment.

456
00:22:06,491 --> 00:22:08,285
‪And then with Hyun-seo…

457
00:22:10,787 --> 00:22:12,247
‪When Hyun-seo

458
00:22:12,831 --> 00:22:15,751
‪was struggling a little bit…

459
00:22:15,834 --> 00:22:17,961
‪-Just for a bit…
‪-When I was turning to the dark side.

460
00:22:18,045 --> 00:22:20,422
‪When she turned to the dark side…

461
00:22:21,590 --> 00:22:22,424
‪Well…

462
00:22:23,050 --> 00:22:25,510
‪I said she was falling behind
‪everyone else.

463
00:22:26,219 --> 00:22:27,095
‪Seriously?

464
00:22:27,179 --> 00:22:28,847
‪-He said that?
‪-You didn't know?

465
00:22:28,930 --> 00:22:30,557
‪-I had no idea.
‪-Wow.

466
00:22:32,225 --> 00:22:35,645
‪I haven't had a chance
‪to talk to anyone else.

467
00:22:35,729 --> 00:22:39,357
‪So I have no idea
‪who to choose as my second pick.

468
00:22:41,526 --> 00:22:43,361
‪You're falling behind everyone else.

469
00:22:45,322 --> 00:22:47,407
‪Jeez, what a jerk.

470
00:22:49,743 --> 00:22:52,579
‪-Nice one!
‪-Fight fire with fire.

471
00:22:53,413 --> 00:22:54,873
‪So I…

472
00:22:54,956 --> 00:22:55,874
‪"FALLING BEHIND" COMMENT A/S

473
00:22:55,957 --> 00:22:59,586
‪I made such a negative comment,

474
00:22:59,669 --> 00:23:02,756
‪and I feel bad and regret that moment.

475
00:23:02,839 --> 00:23:04,424
‪But I wasn't offended.

476
00:23:04,508 --> 00:23:05,342
‪Thank you.

477
00:23:05,425 --> 00:23:06,802
‪I wasn't offended.

478
00:23:08,929 --> 00:23:10,764
‪I didn't know this at the time,

479
00:23:10,847 --> 00:23:14,643
‪but I guess I told Hyun-seo
‪I'd give her the hat I got

480
00:23:15,227 --> 00:23:16,812
‪after dancing with Su-ji.

481
00:23:16,895 --> 00:23:18,939
‪-Apparently, I said that.
‪-That's right. You did.

482
00:23:19,689 --> 00:23:20,857
‪You should take it.

483
00:23:20,941 --> 00:23:22,734
‪Do you want the box or not?

484
00:23:22,818 --> 00:23:24,861
‪-I'd be happy to take it.
‪-Really? Then take it.

485
00:23:26,029 --> 00:23:27,989
‪HE AND SU-JI RECEIVED MATCHING ITEMS

486
00:23:28,073 --> 00:23:29,282
‪It's warm.

487
00:23:29,866 --> 00:23:31,660
‪Are you… Are you very cold?

488
00:23:32,244 --> 00:23:33,745
‪-Yes.
‪-Oh, really?

489
00:23:33,829 --> 00:23:35,997
‪Do you… Do you want to wear this?

490
00:23:37,290 --> 00:23:40,418
‪SU-JI WATCHED HIM

491
00:23:41,128 --> 00:23:42,838
‪The air's nice up here.

492
00:23:44,131 --> 00:23:45,715
‪BOO, SEUNG-HYUN

493
00:23:45,799 --> 00:23:48,385
‪I didn't think anything of it at the time,

494
00:23:48,468 --> 00:23:50,303
‪but I admit that was outrageous.

495
00:23:51,054 --> 00:23:52,139
‪It wasn't that bad.

496
00:23:52,222 --> 00:23:54,724
‪Besides this, I think that overall,

497
00:23:54,808 --> 00:23:58,645
‪I only thought about myself,
‪so I regret that.

498
00:23:58,728 --> 00:24:00,605
‪As for me,

499
00:24:01,481 --> 00:24:04,234
‪I kind of regret not taking the lead

500
00:24:04,317 --> 00:24:06,945
‪in asking for a one-on-one conversation

501
00:24:07,028 --> 00:24:09,072
‪and things like that.

502
00:24:09,156 --> 00:24:10,282
‪Since it's such a short date,

503
00:24:10,365 --> 00:24:13,201
‪if you want a proper chat…

504
00:24:15,245 --> 00:24:17,038
‪Will you call me over?

505
00:24:19,124 --> 00:24:20,167
‪-I think so.
‪-You will?

506
00:24:20,750 --> 00:24:22,419
‪Would you like that?

507
00:24:22,502 --> 00:24:25,589
‪I would like it
‪if you called me over to talk.

508
00:24:25,672 --> 00:24:26,840
‪I'll call you over later, then.

509
00:24:26,923 --> 00:24:27,841
‪-Later.
‪-Later?

510
00:24:28,466 --> 00:24:30,635
‪I regret that a lot.

511
00:24:32,554 --> 00:24:34,681
‪Q. HYUN-SEO, WHAT MOMENT DO YOU REGRET?

512
00:24:34,764 --> 00:24:37,893
‪When we were filming,

513
00:24:37,976 --> 00:24:40,353
‪Hyuk-joon was very sick.

514
00:24:42,397 --> 00:24:45,483
‪I actually heard about that early on,

515
00:24:45,567 --> 00:24:48,236
‪but somewhere along the line,

516
00:24:48,320 --> 00:24:51,448
‪I forgot about it momentarily.

517
00:24:52,407 --> 00:24:55,785
‪Later, when I heard
‪he was sick once again,

518
00:24:55,869 --> 00:24:57,579
‪I realized that I'd messed up.

519
00:24:59,039 --> 00:25:02,751
‪I really failed to be attentive,

520
00:25:02,834 --> 00:25:05,545
‪so I still regret that moment a lot.

521
00:25:09,049 --> 00:25:11,885
‪Q. HYUK-JOON, WHAT MOMENT DO YOU REGRET?

522
00:25:13,511 --> 00:25:16,932
‪I'd already explained this a lot

523
00:25:17,015 --> 00:25:18,892
‪through counseling and such,

524
00:25:20,143 --> 00:25:23,605
‪but I tended to cut people off quickly.

525
00:25:23,688 --> 00:25:25,941
‪I guess I was scared too.

526
00:25:27,525 --> 00:25:30,237
‪Then I decided I needed to change.

527
00:25:30,320 --> 00:25:35,742
‪It took a lot for me to decide
‪to come on a show like this.

528
00:25:35,825 --> 00:25:37,619
‪It was scary, to be honest.

529
00:25:38,787 --> 00:25:39,788
‪So I thought,

530
00:25:40,455 --> 00:25:41,623
‪since I'll be on the show,

531
00:25:41,706 --> 00:25:45,460
‪I might as well be more proactive
‪and make a real effort.

532
00:25:46,878 --> 00:25:50,173
‪But in the process of being proactive,

533
00:25:50,966 --> 00:25:53,343
‪something came over me…

534
00:25:54,761 --> 00:25:55,929
‪I think I was possessed.

535
00:25:56,012 --> 00:25:58,974
‪I just went for any opportunity
‪that came my way.

536
00:25:59,057 --> 00:26:01,726
‪I thought I should take advantage
‪of all opportunities,

537
00:26:01,810 --> 00:26:03,144
‪when it's not work or anything.

538
00:26:04,271 --> 00:26:08,608
‪I should have handled that better,

539
00:26:08,692 --> 00:26:11,695
‪and that's what I regret.

540
00:26:15,156 --> 00:26:18,660
‪Q. HAVE YOU GONE ON A BLIND DATE
‪AFTER THE SHOW? (O/X)

541
00:26:22,664 --> 00:26:23,873
‪You have?

542
00:26:23,957 --> 00:26:25,542
‪-Am I the only one?
‪-Huh?

543
00:26:27,043 --> 00:26:28,211
‪No one else?

544
00:26:28,295 --> 00:26:29,296
‪Jung-yun too.

545
00:26:29,379 --> 00:26:30,255
‪-Why keep it from us?
‪-You have?

546
00:26:30,338 --> 00:26:31,798
‪Why didn't you tell us?

547
00:26:31,881 --> 00:26:32,924
‪You went on a blind date?

548
00:26:33,008 --> 00:26:34,217
‪Why didn't you say anything?

549
00:26:34,301 --> 00:26:36,303
‪-What the heck?
‪-That's big news.

550
00:26:36,386 --> 00:26:38,221
‪-Why didn't you tell us?
‪-That's huge.

551
00:26:38,305 --> 00:26:39,514
‪-I feel so betrayed.
‪-Me too.

552
00:26:39,597 --> 00:26:42,100
‪How can I say anything
‪if nothing came out of it?

553
00:26:42,183 --> 00:26:44,352
‪You could've just told us
‪how it was and stuff.

554
00:26:44,853 --> 00:26:46,604
‪I saw her last week.

555
00:26:48,064 --> 00:26:49,649
‪Why didn't you tell us?

556
00:26:49,733 --> 00:26:51,735
‪Why keep it a secret?

557
00:26:51,818 --> 00:26:52,902
‪Hey.

558
00:26:53,528 --> 00:26:54,946
‪I went last week,

559
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:57,198
‪and it was our second date.

560
00:26:57,282 --> 00:26:59,117
‪-Your second date?
‪-Wow, a second date.

561
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:00,035
‪So we met…

562
00:27:00,618 --> 00:27:02,495
‪Yeah, and we had a second date.

563
00:27:02,579 --> 00:27:05,081
‪When I came back home after the date,

564
00:27:05,165 --> 00:27:07,250
‪she suddenly messaged me
‪and said we should talk on the phone.

565
00:27:07,834 --> 00:27:09,461
‪So I called her…

566
00:27:10,378 --> 00:27:11,546
‪-That's crazy.
‪-The thing is…

567
00:27:12,380 --> 00:27:15,342
‪-What is it?
‪-She said my energy level was too low

568
00:27:16,092 --> 00:27:18,219
‪and that she doesn't want to see me again.

569
00:27:18,303 --> 00:27:20,430
‪-Oh, dear.
‪-It was a rejection call.

570
00:27:20,513 --> 00:27:24,976
‪That's right. She told me
‪that she didn't want to waste time.

571
00:27:25,935 --> 00:27:27,228
‪Really?

572
00:27:27,729 --> 00:27:28,938
‪I mean…

573
00:27:29,522 --> 00:27:31,483
‪I felt so troubled.

574
00:27:31,566 --> 00:27:33,526
‪So I went out to have a burger by myself.

575
00:27:33,610 --> 00:27:35,195
‪-Did you cry?
‪-No.

576
00:27:35,278 --> 00:27:36,613
‪I just felt really troubled.

577
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:41,284
‪Q. (FINAL COUPLES EXCLUDED) HAVE YOU MET
‪ONE-ON-ONE WITH ANOTHER PARTICIPANT? (O/X)

578
00:27:42,577 --> 00:27:44,245
‪-I hope someone raises "O."
‪-Seriously.

579
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:46,081
‪I think it'll be so fun.

580
00:27:46,164 --> 00:27:47,207
‪Jeez…

581
00:27:47,290 --> 00:27:48,708
‪SIGHS

582
00:27:53,004 --> 00:27:54,130
‪It's a little…

583
00:27:55,673 --> 00:27:56,508
‪It's a bit…

584
00:27:57,592 --> 00:27:58,968
‪You two got lovey-dovey, huh?

585
00:27:59,052 --> 00:28:00,470
‪-"Lovey-dovey"?
‪-The two of you

586
00:28:00,553 --> 00:28:02,680
‪-went for a ride in that swan boat.
‪-That's right.

587
00:28:02,764 --> 00:28:04,140
‪You went on a swan boat?

588
00:28:04,224 --> 00:28:05,266
‪-How romantic.
‪-It was a date.

589
00:28:05,350 --> 00:28:06,184
‪That's a date.

590
00:28:06,267 --> 00:28:07,602
‪It was pure academic curiosity.

591
00:28:08,103 --> 00:28:10,063
‪It was academic curiosity

592
00:28:10,146 --> 00:28:11,648
‪-on how swan boats operate.
‪-That's a lie.

593
00:28:11,731 --> 00:28:13,024
‪-Come on.
‪-Stop lying.

594
00:28:13,108 --> 00:28:15,276
‪-Boo.
‪-What a lame excuse.

595
00:28:15,360 --> 00:28:18,738
‪I was just asking for advice
‪on the swan boat.

596
00:28:19,406 --> 00:28:23,034
‪Q. (ANONYMOUS TIP) APPARENTLY,
‪SEUNG-HYUN MET WITH A FEMALE PARTICIPANT

597
00:28:23,118 --> 00:28:23,993
‪You met with someone?

598
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:29,666
‪Who?

599
00:28:41,052 --> 00:28:41,886
‪I mean…

600
00:28:43,012 --> 00:28:44,431
‪Did you tell them?

601
00:28:45,473 --> 00:28:46,349
‪I didn't!

602
00:28:46,433 --> 00:28:47,851
‪Wait, hold on…

603
00:28:47,934 --> 00:28:49,477
‪-What the heck?
‪-What's going on?

604
00:28:49,561 --> 00:28:51,020
‪What's with all the secrets?

605
00:28:51,104 --> 00:28:53,440
‪It's not like that.
‪I thought you told them.

606
00:28:53,523 --> 00:28:55,024
‪-I didn't!
‪-It wasn't you?

607
00:28:55,108 --> 00:28:58,194
<i>‪You two are busted</i>

608
00:28:58,778 --> 00:29:00,822
‪-What did you two do?
‪-Tell us. Spill the beans.

609
00:29:00,905 --> 00:29:01,781
‪I mean…

610
00:29:02,741 --> 00:29:04,033
‪I'm giving you an "X."

611
00:29:04,117 --> 00:29:05,660
‪-Oh my gosh.
‪-We just…

612
00:29:07,245 --> 00:29:08,329
‪Oh, I guess we did.

613
00:29:08,913 --> 00:29:10,540
‪-What was that?
‪-Give it to us straight!

614
00:29:10,623 --> 00:29:12,709
‪-What is it?
‪-Explain yourself!

615
00:29:12,792 --> 00:29:15,044
‪I just happened to go to Jinju.

616
00:29:15,128 --> 00:29:17,505
‪We hung out and had a good time.
‪I just forgot about it.

617
00:29:17,589 --> 00:29:18,715
‪I didn't mean to lie.

618
00:29:19,340 --> 00:29:21,593
‪TO HAVE A MORE OPEN CONVERSATION

619
00:29:21,676 --> 00:29:23,636
‪He lives there, so…

620
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,721
‪We hung out and had a good time.

621
00:29:24,804 --> 00:29:25,805
‪-That's right.
‪-Right.

622
00:29:27,098 --> 00:29:28,433
‪THE "CHAIR OF TRUTH" WAITS ON STAGE

623
00:29:28,516 --> 00:29:29,350
‪So you guys went on a date.

624
00:29:30,518 --> 00:29:33,605
‪LET'S GET TO THE BOTTOM OF THE TRUTH

625
00:29:37,025 --> 00:29:40,445
‪Seung-hyun, how did you feel
‪when we met up in Jinju?

626
00:29:42,530 --> 00:29:43,364
‪Wow.

627
00:29:57,462 --> 00:29:59,464
‪Subtitle translation by:
‪Jenny Kim
